Do not ship `StrSheet_Abnormality`.

## Encoding

- Shop comma `StrSheet_UI` `$005006` is `,`
- Hash in UI and on F-buttons is a color code. Never numeric `&#` on F-buttons.
- Item and Quest HTML: `&amp;#NNN;`
- UI labels: Unicode, no numeric `&#`
